// Documentation
// This ValueSet contains UNII codes for oncology substances that do not have
// established ATC codes. These are typically newer or experimental drugs
// used in clinical trials or recently approved therapies.
//
// Usage: Use this ValueSet as an alternative when ATC codes are not available
// Binding: Can be used alongside the main ATC ValueSet in extensible bindings
//
